## False positive traps by entity type

### PERSON traps
- Brand names: "Jack Daniel's Tennessee Whiskey", "Jimmy John's sandwich", "Ben & Jerry's ice cream"
- Place-derived names: "the Ford dealership", "Wells Fargo ATM", "Morgan Stanley index"
- Literary/historical: "Einstein's theory", "Shakespeare's works", "Darwin's finches"
- Generic role: "Dr. Smith says" (generic example), "the Johnson family" (generic)
- Sports teams: "the Warriors defeated the Lakers"

### ADDRESS traps
- Landmarks: "at Wall Street", "on Broadway", "near Times Square"
- Directions: "north of Main Street and 5th Avenue"
- Building names: "the Empire State Building lobby", "Rockefeller Center plaza"
- Fictional: "221B Baker Street" (literary), "742 Evergreen Terrace" (TV)
- General locations: "downtown Chicago", "the Bay Area", "Silicon Valley"
- ZIP code contexts: "the 90210 zip code area"

### DATE_OF_BIRTH traps
- Historical: "on July 4, 1776", "December 7, 1941", "September 11, 2001"
- Business: "Q4 2024 earnings", "fiscal year ending March 31, 2025"
- Deadlines: "submit by 03/15/2025", "due April 1, 2024"
- Events: "the 2024 Olympics", "Super Bowl on February 11"
- Product dates: "manufactured 08/2023", "best before 12/25/2025"
- Anniversaries: "celebrating 50 years since 1974"

### ORGANIZATION traps
- Generic: "the company announced", "our firm reported", "the agency confirmed"
- Standards: "ISO 9001 certified", "per FDA guidelines", "OSHA compliant"
- Products as org: "the Google approach", "an Apple-like design", "Amazon shipping"
- Media: "CNN reported", "according to Reuters", "the Times published"

### BANK_ACCOUNT traps
- Order numbers: "Order #ORD-2024-0315-78543"
- Confirmation: "Confirmation: ABC123DEF456"
- Serial: "S/N: XK4829-001-AB"
- Phone: "call 1-800-555-0123"
- Routing-like: "FedEx tracking: 794644790132"

